#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3000
msgid "About Advanced IP Blocker"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3003
msgid "Version:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3004
msgid "Thank you for using our plugin! This tool helps protect your WordPress site by automatically blocking malicious IPs based on their behavior."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3006
msgid "Key Features Overview:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3008
msgid "Zero-Day Vulnerability Prevention:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3008
msgid "Deploys surgical WAF rules to block exploits targeting newly discovered and unpatched vulnerabilities before they compromise your site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3009
msgid "Advanced Rules Cloud Sync:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3009
msgid "Automatically synchronizes your local WAF rules and signatures with our centralized cloud database, ensuring you are always protected against the latest global threats."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3010
msgid "Site Health & Vulnerability Scanner:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3010
msgid "Audit your WordPress environment for weaknesses and check installed plugins against a database of 30,000+ known security vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3011
msgid "File Integrity Monitoring (FIM):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3011
msgid "Continuously monitors your WordPress core, plugin, and theme files for unauthorized changes or malware injections, alerting you instantly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3012
msgid "Manual Integrity Scanner:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3012
msgid "Perform on-demand, deep scans of your entire filesystem to verify file checksums and detect hidden modifications or backdoors."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3013
msgid "Community Defense Network:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3013
msgid "A global collaborative network that shares verified attack data to block emerging threats in real-time across all participating sites."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3014
msgid "Distributed Attack Protection (Auto-Panic):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3014
msgid "Automatically shields your entire site with a global JS challenge during massive traffic spikes, keeping your server online while intelligently bypassing trusted bots and excluded routes."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3015
msgid "Ghost IP Defense:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3015
msgid "Automatically detects and blocks stealthy \"Ghost IPs\" that lack ASN or Reverse DNS (rDNS) records, shielding your site from sophisticated anonymized attacks and untraceable bots."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3016
msgid "IP Inspector:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3016
msgid "A comprehensive diagnostic tool to analyze any IP address or ASN against all security layers, local whitelists, and third-party threat databases in real-time."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3017
msgid "Cloud Edge Defense (Cloudflare):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3017
msgid "Connects your site to the Cloudflare Firewall to block malicious IPs at the network edge, preventing them from ever reaching your server. Zero load protection."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3018
msgid "Server-Level Firewall (.htaccess):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3018
msgid "Writes blocking rules directly to your server configuration for extreme performance. Also hardens sensitive files like wp-config.php."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3019
msgid "AbuseIPDB Integration:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3019
msgid "Proactively checks visitor IP reputation against a global crowdsourced database of hackers and spammers, blocking bad actors on their very first request."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3020
msgid "IP Trust & Threat Scoring System:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3020
msgid "An advanced defense that assigns threat points for malicious actions, blocking IPs based on their cumulative score for more accurate, context-aware security."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3021
msgid "Attack Signature Engine:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3021
msgid "A proactive defense that detects distributed botnet attacks by analyzing request \"fingerprints\" and stops them with an invisible JavaScript challenge."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3022
msgid "Endpoint Lockdown Mode:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3022
msgid "Automatically shields critical endpoints like wp-login.php and xmlrpc.php with a challenge mode during sustained distributed attacks, preventing server overload."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3023
msgid "Captcha Integrations (Turnstile & hCaptcha):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3023
msgid "Seamlessly integrate modern verification challenges like Cloudflare Turnstile and hCaptcha, with granular control per module and a smart fallback to our invisible JS Challenge to prevent accidental lockouts."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3024
msgid "Two-Factor Authentication (2FA):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3024
msgid "Secure user accounts with TOTP authentication, backup codes, and role enforcement. Fully manageable via UI and WP-CLI."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3025
msgid "Security Dashboard:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3025
msgid "Get a real-time visual overview of all threats with interactive charts and a live attack map."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3026
msgid "High-Performance Geolocation:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3026
msgid "Choose between real-time APIs or a high-performance local MaxMind database for IP lookups, ensuring speed and reliability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3027
msgid "Web Application Firewall (WAF):"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3027
msgid "Proactively block malicious requests (SQLi, XSS, etc.) with customizable rules."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3028
msgid "Rate Limiting:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3028
msgid "Prevent DoS and brute-force attacks by limiting request frequency."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3029
msgid "Country & ASN Blocking:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3029
msgid "Block traffic from entire countries or networks (ASNs), with support for the Spamhaus list and a new ASN Whitelist feature."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3030
msgid "Advanced Login Protection:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3030
msgid "Harden your login page by disabling user enumeration, protecting XML-RPC, and restricting access to whitelisted IPs."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3031
msgid "Comprehensive Audit Logging:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-advaipbl-admin-pages.php:3031
msgid "Tracks and logs all critical administrative actions and configuration changes, providing a complete security trail for forensic analysis."
msgstr ""

